	"title"		"Netherlands / Dutch Expansion 尼德兰/荷兰重置"
	"description"		"The Netherlands renounces the monarchy and returns to the Republic of the United Provinces. A HOI4 1.19.* mod with a Regency/Commoners Balance of Power, a shared Commonwealth Council focus tree (West Indies / East Indies / South Africa), a Colonial Obedience system, progressive national spirits, a reformed military and Brother Republics. Created by AI (WorkBuddy) together with the mod author. | 尼德兰/荷兰重置：荷兰放弃君主制，重回联省共和国。含摄政/平民权力平衡、与西印度/东印度/南非共享的联邦议会国策树、殖民地服从度系统、逐级强化的民族精神、改革军事与兄弟共和国。由 AI（WorkBuddy）与作者共同创作。"
